      "content": "it's not just about letting go of the stress though. it's more than that. it's like the whole mistake is just part of me now. the shame of it, the debt... it's just a permanent part of my life from now on. sometimes i think about it like, if i'm just gone, the debt isn't a thing anymore and the shame just stops existing. would that even be a bad thing? to just stop the cycle entirely?",
